(What is the role of connections in the UiPath Integration Service?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 735.8899999999999864 Td
(A. Connections establish tasks and exchanges between users and external applications using the) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 717.8899999999999864 Td
(authentication process of the API provider.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 693.8899999999999864 Td
(B. Connections establish tasks and exchanges based on a connector's compatibility with the) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 675.8899999999999864 Td
(external) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 657.8899999999999864 Td
(application.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 633.8899999999999864 Td
(C. Connections establish tasks and exchanges between users and external applications using the) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 615.8899999999999864 Td
(authentication process of the UI automation provider.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 591.8899999999999864 Td
(D. Connections establish tasks and exchanges between users and external applications using the) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 573.8899999999999864 Td
(server-side triggers.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12.5 Tf
14.3749999999999982 TL
