(Answer:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 521.8899999999999864 Td
(A) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12.5 Tf
14.3749999999999982 TL
0. g
40. 489.8899999999999864 Td
(Explanation:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 467.8899999999999864 Td
(In the UiPath Integration Service, a "Connection" is the authenticated link between UiPath and an) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 449.8899999999999864 Td
(external application \(e.g., Salesforce, ServiceNow\). Its primary role is to securely store the) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 431.8899999999999864 Td
(authentication credentials and tokens \(like OAuth 2.0\) required to communicate with the target) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 413.8899999999999864 Td
(application's API. By handling the authentication process of the API provider, connections enable) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 395.8899999999999864 Td
(automations and triggers to securely perform tasks and exchange data with that external system.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12.5 Tf
14.3749999999999982 TL
0. g
40. 363.8899999999999864 Td
(Why Incorrect Options are Wrong:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 341.8899999999999864 Td
(B. Connector compatibility is a prerequisite for creating a connection, not the function of the) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 323.8899999999999864 Td
(connection itself.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 305.8899999999999864 Td
(C. Integration Service operates at the API level, not through UI automation. Connections) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 287.8899999999999864 Td
(authenticate with APIs, not UI providers.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 269.8899999999999864 Td
(D. Server-side triggers use connections to initiate processes, but the connection's fundamental) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 251.8899999999999864 Td
(role is to establish the authenticated link, not to be the trigger.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12.5 Tf
14.3749999999999982 TL
0. g
40. 219.8899999999999864 Td
(References:) Tj
