BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 179.8899999999999864 Td
("About Connections". The documentation states) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 161.8899999999999864 Td
("A connection is a credential and the means to connect to a specific application... Connections) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 143.8899999999999864 Td
(are required to use connectors in your automations." It further explains that connections manage) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 125.8899999999999864 Td
(the authentication required by the third-party application.) Tj
