60. 557.8899999999999864 Td
(The UiPath Integration Service is built upon three core components that work together to enable) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 539.8899999999999864 Td
(event-driven automation and API integration. These components are:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 521.8899999999999864 Td
(1. Connectors: Pre-built integrations that define the available activities and events for a specific) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 503.8899999999999864 Td
(third-party application \(e.g., Salesforce, Microsoft Outlook\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 485.8899999999999864 Td
(2. Connections: Authenticated instances of a connector. A connection securely stores the) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 467.8899999999999864 Td
(credentials and configuration needed to access a specific account in a target application.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 449.8899999999999864 Td
(3. Triggers: Subscriptions to events within a connected application. When a specified event) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 431.8899999999999864 Td
(occurs, a trigger fires and starts an associated UiPath automation.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12.5 Tf
14.3749999999999982 TL
0. g
40. 399.8899999999999864 Td
(Why Incorrect Options are Wrong:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 377.8899999999999864 Td
(A. API Tokens are a means of authentication used to establish Connections; they are not a main) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 359.8899999999999864 Td
(component of the service itself.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 341.8899999999999864 Td
(B. Orchestrator is the platform where automations are executed and managed, but it is a separate) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 323.8899999999999864 Td
(UiPath product, not a component of the Integration Service.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 305.8899999999999864 Td
(D. Activities are used in Studio to build the automation workflow, but Connectors are the) Tj
