13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 413.8899999999999864 Td
(B. StrVar.Substring\(1, 5\) would incorrectly return five characters starting from the second) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 395.8899999999999864 Td
(character, not four.) Tj
