(What is an advantage of utilizing UiPath Orchestrator queues?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 735.8899999999999864 Td
(A. Capability to modify the retry count at the queue level after its creation.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 711.8899999999999864 Td
(B. Capability to track the status of Queue Items.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 687.8899999999999864 Td
(C. Allows several robots to handle the same Queue Item simultaneously.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 663.8899999999999864 Td
(D. Guarantees each queue is exclusively processed by a single robot, by default.) Tj
ET
