(Explanation:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 557.8899999999999864 Td
(UiPath Orchestrator queues provide a centralized way to manage and monitor transactional work) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 539.8899999999999864 Td
(items. A key advantage is the ability to track the status of each queue item as it moves through) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 521.8899999999999864 Td
(the automation lifecycle \(e.g., New, In Progress, Successful, Failed\). This visibility is crucial for) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 503.8899999999999864 Td
(monitoring, reporting, and handling exceptions in transactional processes, ensuring that all items) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0. g
60. 485.8899999999999864 Td
(are processed correctly.) Tj
